        heroCaption: "Turing's initial gameplay modules and shared world loop.",
        content: `<section><h2 id="eight-pillars">Eight gameplay pillars</h2><div class="feature-grid"><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">FISH</span><h3>Fishing</h3><p>Read the water, choose equipment, and control tension to collect aquatic resources.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">COMBAT</span><h3>Combat</h3><p>Roles, skills, equipment, positioning, and teamwork shape real-time encounters.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">PVP</span><h3>PVP</h3><p>Fair matchmaking, seasonal ladders, arenas, and Guild competition.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">BOX</span><h3>Mystery boxes</h3><p>Published odds and safeguards support event and collection rewards.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">MINE</span><h3>Mining</h3><p>Prospect, manage tools and danger, and supply materials for equipment and building.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">QUEST</span><h3>Adventure</h3><p>World maps, stories, co-op dungeons, and dynamic events connect every system.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">BUILD</span><h3>Building</h3><p>Combine land, facilities, and decoration into productive and social spaces.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">GROW</span><h3>Farming</h3><p>Research soil, seeds, minerals, and recipes through changing seasons.</p></div></div></section><section><h2 id="shared-loop">Shared progression loop</h2><ol class="flow-list"><li><b>Discover</b><span>Maps, weather, seasons, and community events create goals.</span></li><li><b>Act</b><span>Play solo, in a party, or through a Guild.</span></li><li><b>Produce</b><span>Earn experience, materials, GEM, and useful assets.</span></li><li><b>Transform</b><span>Craft, upgrade, build, trade, or redeem outputs.</span></li><li><b>Reinvest</b><span>Better tools and coordination unlock deeper content.</span></li></ol></section><section><h2 id="economy-boundary">Gameplay and economy boundaries</h2><p>Everyday play remains free or accessible. Scarce assets may provide efficiency, expression, social identity, or new play options, but they do not sell invincibility. Seasonal and realized-revenue budgets constrain rewards.</p><div class="callout"><p><strong>Standard:</strong> players may buy choices and expression, not unbeatable power. Competitive modes use normalization, brackets, or caps.</p></div></section>`
