        content: `<section><h2 id="fixed-supply">Fixed supply</h2><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat"><b>500M</b><span>Fixed TUR supply</span></div><div class="stat"><b>0</b><span>Additional protocol issuance</span></div></div></section><section><h2 id="allocation">Allocation</h2><div class="data-table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Share</th><th>Release principle</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Nodes and genesis rights</td><td>35%</td><td>Locked, staged, and tied to node rules</td></tr><tr><td>Ecosystem and gameplay</td><td>25%</td><td>Activity, content budget, and health-based release</td></tr><tr><td>Team and advisors</td><td>15%</td><td>Long lock, linear vesting, milestone-linked</td></tr><tr><td>Strategic partners</td><td>10%</td><td>Released against delivery and contribution</td></tr><tr><td>Liquidity and market</td><td>10%</td><td>Compliant liquidity and price discovery</td></tr><tr><td>DAO treasury</td><td>5%</td><td>Proposal, vote, timelock, and public execution</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section><h2 id="disclosure">Disclosure</h2><p>Addresses and vesting progress should be public before launch. Changes require advance disclosure and applicable governance.</p><div class="callout warning"><p>TUR, GEM, and NFTs may be volatile or illiquid. Holding them does not guarantee income, buybacks, or appreciation.</p></div></section>`
