        heroAlt: "Turing players inviting friends through a transparent two-level relationship",
        heroCaption: "Referrals connect real players and shared play while keeping reward sources and levels visible.",
        content: `
          <section><h2 id="referral-rates">Two-level rules</h2><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat"><b>70%</b><span>Eligible spending allocated to the ten-level referral pool</span></div><div class="stat"><b>10 levels</b><span>Maximum referral depth</span></div><div class="stat"><b>Weighted</b><span>Distribution inside the pool</span></div><div class="stat"><b>After launch</b><span>Player referral system activation</span></div></div><div class="data-table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Relationship</th><th>Spending user</th><th>Reward recipient</th><th>Reward reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A directly invites B</td><td>B</td><td>A</td><td>7% of B's eligible game spending</td></tr><tr><td>A invites B; B invites C</td><td>C</td><td>B</td><td>7% of C's eligible game spending</td></tr><tr><td>A invites B; B invites C</td><td>C</td><td>A</td><td>2% of C's eligible game spending</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
          <section><h2 id="referral-example">Worked example</h2><div class="reward-example" aria-labelledby="player-referral-example-title-en"><div class="reward-example-head"><span class="reward-example-kicker">EXAMPLE · 30 DAYS</span><h3 id="player-referral-example-title-en">Ten direct players, each spending 30 U per day</h3><p>Assume all ten players record 30 U of eligible net spending on each of 30 consecutive days.</p></div><div class="reward-example-grid"><article class="reward-example-card"><span>Level-one direct · 7%</span><div class="reward-formula" aria-label="ten players multiplied by 30 U per day multiplied by 30 days multiplied by seven percent"><b>10 players</b><i>×</i><b>30 U / day</b><i>×</i><b>30 days</b><i>×</i><b>7%</b></div><div class="reward-result"><span>30-day player reward reference</span><strong>= 630 U</strong></div></article><article class="reward-example-card is-secondary"><span>Level-two indirect · 2% comparison</span><div class="reward-formula" aria-label="ten level-two players multiplied by 30 U per day multiplied by 30 days multiplied by two percent"><b>10 players</b><i>×</i><b>30 U / day</b><i>×</i><b>30 days</b><i>×</i><b>2%</b></div><div class="reward-result"><span>30-day reference if level two</span><strong>= 180 U</strong></div></article></div><div class="reward-example-total"><div><span>Combined with the node-referral example</span><small>1,000 U node × 10 × 10% + 10 players × 30 U × 30 days × 7%</small></div><strong>1,000 U + 630 U = 1,630 U</strong></div></div><div class="callout"><p><strong>The 1,630 U total is an arithmetic illustration of two formulas, not a cash-return promise.</strong> The 1,000 U is the stated value of node-referral NFTs; 630 U is the player-spending reward reference. Reward assets, settlement cycles, and permitted uses remain separate.</p></div></section>
          <section><h2 id="eligible-consumption">Eligible spending and settlement boundaries</h2><ul><li>Eligible spending means completed, non-reversible net in-game consumption. Refunds, chargebacks, reversals, taxes, fees, grants, and abnormal transactions are excluded.</li><li>Only two levels are counted. If C invites D, A receives no reward from D's spending.</li><li>Self-referrals, fabricated accounts, circular referrals, bots, wash activity, and related-account abuse are excluded and may be reviewed.</li><li>Assets, regions, campaigns, or spending types may have separate caps, cooling-off periods, or exclusions shown before payment.</li></ul></section>
          <section><h2 id="referral-separation">Separate from node referrals</h2><p>This page covers <strong>player consumption referrals after game launch</strong>. Node-purchase referrals remain governed by the Node Purchase page and use a referral NFT issued after valid node delivery. Eligibility, settlement, and records remain separate.</p><div class="callout warning"><p>The 7% and 2% figures are reward-calculation ratios, not deposit interest, fixed returns, or ownership of another user's assets. Final operation remains subject to the launch rules, technical validation, and applicable law.</p></div></section>`
